# Optional: GitHub personal access token used at build time by the Contributions
# section to fetch top repositories by commits without hitting the low
# unauthenticated rate limit (60 req/hr). A classic token needs no scopes for
# public data; a fine-grained token needs read-only "Contents" + "Metadata".
# Without it the section still renders — it just falls back to showing no repo
# list if the unauthenticated quota is exhausted.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
